# URL of the A2A agent server. Unset, it defaults to the host you loaded the page
# from on port 4000 — so LAN/phone access needs nothing here. Set it only when the
# agent lives somewhere other than the machine serving the UI.
VITE_AGENT_URL=
# URL of the file-storage service (attachment uploads). Same derivation, port 6060.
VITE_FILE_STORAGE_URL=
